kind: graph
dir: down
title: How callee facts are computed
node a "CallGraph::bottom_up\ncallees machined first"
node b "for each eligible callee:\nmachine it, then record\nwhat it wrote" fill=b
node c "each direct caller:\na value may stay in any\nregister the callee did not\nwrite, scratch ones too" fill=c
edge a -> b
edge b -> c "written = registers written\nby body and its calls,\nminus those its prologue\nsaves whole"
